7: Manifest accumulates assets across multiple files\n- [ ] B2.8: Does not double-process already-rewritten `/assets/...` URLs\n\n**Hook:** `transformContent`\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/asset-pipeline.test.ts` (8 tests)\n\n### 3. syntax-highlight (`createSyntaxHighlightPlugin`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- [ ] B3.1: Adds `highlighted` class to `<code class=\"language-xxx\">` tags (result: `class=\"language-xxx highlighted\"`)\n- [ ] B3.2: Adds `data-language=\"xxx\"` attribute to parent `<pre>` tags\n- [ ] B3.3: Handles multiple code blocks in one file — each gets correct language\n- [ ] B3.4: Code blocks with no language specified are left unchanged\n- [ ] B3.5: Code block content is preserved\n- [ ] B3.6: Empty code blocks with language still get highlighting\n- [ ] B3.7: Inline `<code>` tags (not inside `<pre>`) are NOT modified\n\n**Hook:** `transformContent`\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/syntax-highlight.test.ts` (8 tests)\n\n### 4. taxonomy (`createTaxonomyPlugin`)\n\n**Behavior:**\n- [ ] B4.1: Builds tag index from file `tags` arrays, stored as `taxonomy-tags` Map in ctx.data\n- [ ] B4.2: Tag index maps tag name → array of ContentFile objects\n- [ ] B4.3: Generates tag listing pages in ctx.output at `tags/{tag}.html`\n- [ ] B4.4: Tag pages contain file titles for files with that tag\n- [ ] B4.5: Files with no tags are excluded from index\n- [ ] B4.6: A file with multiple tags appears under each tag\n- [ ] B4.7: Tag map is stored in ctx.data after beforeBuild\n- [ ] B4.8: Empty file list produces empty tag map\n- [ ] B4.9: Tags are case-normalized to lowercase\n\n**Hooks:** `beforeBuild` (build index), `afterBuild` (generate pages)\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/taxonomy.test.ts` (8 tests)\n\n---\n\n## Wave 2 — Depend on Wave 1\n\n### 5. rss-feed (`createRssFeedPlugin`)\n\n**Dependencies:** `['markdown-ext', 'taxonomy']`\n\n**Behavior:**\n- [ ] B5.1: Generates `feed.xml` in ctx.output with valid RSS 2.0 XML structure\n- [ ] B5.2: Feed items wrap HTML content in `<![CDATA[...]]>`\n- [ ] B5.3: Feed items include `<category>` tags from taxonomy plugin data\n- [ ] B5.4: Feed `<channel>` title comes from config.title\n- [ ] B5.5: Feed items sorted by date, newest first\n- [ ] B5.6: Files without dates are included but no `<pubDate>undefined</pubDate>`\n- [ ] B5.7: Feed `<link>` uses baseUrl from config\n- [ ] B5.8: Item `<link>` uses `{baseUrl}/{slug}.html` format\n\n**Hook:** `afterBuild`\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/rss-feed.test.ts` (8 tests)\n\n### 6. search-index (`createSearchIndexPlugin`)\n\n**Dependencies:** `['markdown-ext', 'syntax-highlight']`\n\n**Behavior:**\n- [ ] B6.1: Generates `search-index.json` in ctx.output\n- [ ] B6.2: Index entries have `slug`, `title`, `content` (plain text)\n- [ ] B6.3: HTML tags are stripped from indexed content\n- [ ] B6.4: Code block content is included in searchable text\n- [ ] B6.5: Empty file list produces `[]`\n- [ ] B6.6: Output is valid JSON\n- [ ] B6.7: Index entries include `tags` array if present on file\n\n**Hook:** `afterBuild`\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/search-index.test.ts` (7 tests)\n\n---\n\n## Wave 3 — Depend on Wave 2\n\n### 7. sitemap (`createSitemapPlugin`)\n\n**Dependencies:** `['taxonomy', 'rss-feed']`\n\n**Behavior:**\n- [ ] B7.1: Generates `sitemap.xml` in ctx.output\n- [ ] B7.2: Includes all content page URLs (from ctx.output keys)\n- [ ] B7.3: Includes taxonomy tag page URLs\n- [ ] B7.4: Includes feed.xml URL\n- [ ] B7.5: URLs use baseUrl from config\n- [ ] B7.6: Valid XML structure: `<?xml version=\"1.0\"`, `<urlset>`, `<url>`, `<loc>`\n- [ ] B7.7: Handles site with no tag pages (no `/tags/` URLs)\n\n**Hook:** `afterBuild`\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/sitemap.test.ts` (7 tests)\n\n### 8. dev-server (`createDevServerPlugin`)\n\n**Dependencies:** `['asset-pipeline', 'search-index']`\n\n**Behavior:**\n- [ ] B8.1: Stores `dev-server-config` in ctx.data\n- [ ] B8.2: Config has numeric `port` field\n- [ ] B8.3: Config includes asset routes from `asset-manifest` in ctx.data\n- [ ] B8.4: Asset routes have handler `'asset'` and appear in `assetPaths`\n- [ ] B8.5: Config includes `searchIndexPath` (value `/search-index.json`)\n- [ ] B8.6: Config includes content routes with handler `'static'`\n- [ ] B8.7: Default port is 3000\n- [ ] B8.8: Missing asset-pipeline data handled gracefully → assetPaths is []\n\n**Hook:** `afterBuild`\n**Verification:** `tests/plugins/dev-server.test.ts` (7 tests)\n\n---\n\n## Combined Verification\n\n- [ ] **V1:** `npm test` — all 75 tests pass (15 existing + 60 new)\n- [ ] **V2:** `npm run build` — TypeScript compiles without errors\n- [ ] **V3:** `npm run lint` — ESLint produces no warnings or errors\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":59,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":41600,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a81b8e73-ed74-464f-829b-2ff036512997","uuid":"a0881f9d-e1a2-44fa-bbf8-c8b05b4d7d42"}
