pproach of iterating ctx.output keys would include `tags/javascript.html`. So it works without special handling.\n\nBut what if the taxonomy pages are NOT in ctx.output because the taxonomy plugin hasn't been called? That's an ordering issue that the engine handles via dependencies. Since sitemap depends on taxonomy and rss-feed, they run first and their afterBuild hooks populate ctx.output.\n\nBut the test calls `plugin.hooks.afterBuild!(ctx)` directly with a pre-populated ctx. So the output already has what's needed. Good.\n\nLet me implement.","signature":"ffbef9b9-4fce-47e4-8aaa-34981b326062"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":55296,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a81b8e73-ed74-464f-829b-2ff036512997","uuid":"f780606d-a61c-4c8f-af43-dd09b21c2bca"}
